Models

u2netp.onnx
  U^2-Net (small, "u2netp") by Xuebin Qin et al., Apache License 2.0,
  https://github.com/xuebinqin/U-2-Net
  ONNX export as distributed by rembg (MIT), https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg
  (release v0.0.0, file u2netp.onnx, sha256 309c8469258dda742793dce0ebea8e6dd393174f89934733ecc8b14c76f4ddd8), unmodified.

isnet-general-w8.onnx
  IS-Net / DIS general-use model by Xuebin Qin et al., Apache License 2.0,
  https://github.com/xuebinqin/DIS
  Derived from rembg's isnet-general-use.onnx export (https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg).
  Modification: convolution weights stored as 8-bit (per-output-channel uint8 with
  DequantizeLinear), reducing the file from 179 MB to 47 MB. Computation is unchanged (float32).

Apache License 2.0 full text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
